(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-cultivation-37","version":"0a6b940755c1","book":"mountain-ledger","cn":["沈砚没[[pretend|假装]]返乡就是事情结束，钟楼前一位[[civilian|普通村民]]正问欠薪。他[[beloved|珍爱的]]药田已经抽叶，两半银扣仍[[safe|安全地]]钉在旧处。顾峦用[[elastic|弹性的]]麻绳修过钟槌[[joint|接缝]]，没有再被带走。他说守水不用[[military|军事的]]号令，可雨夜的跑钟人需像[[athlete|竞跑者]]一样稳。沈砚扶起[[upright|竖直的]]旧水尺，许庭辨认其绑绳是退下的[[naval|海军的]]船索，便说货路迟早能接通。顾峦没答这句远话，只问眼前留下的普通人谁来付钱。","季禾教青年[[forge|锻打]]铁环，顾峦将绳[[knot|打结]]，一个[[kid|孩子]]送来半瓶[[honey|蜂蜜]]给罗清。木闸的[[screw|螺钉]]沾着[[ore|矿石]]粉，记录有一次[[slight|轻微的]]漏水，守闸人很[[hesitant|犹豫]]，怕说出会破坏好消息。沈砚请他照实讲，城里像[[hell|地狱]]的夜晚已经教过自己，遮坏消息会累到下一班。罗清把新[[fabric|织布]]交给医馆，先确认周伯孙女这段日子住得好；孩子指给她看自己补好的碗套，说如今也能帮人，没人要她再证明爷爷说的真假。","这条不用修为的水路曾很[[revolutionary|革新]]，[[following|接下来的]]路却不能靠赞声。顾衡不以[[force|力量]]封山，沈砚从上游公约[[derive|追得]]三家取水义务，旧池[[capacity|容量]]未变，截流的[[feature|特点]]却已变：私闸放在公共取水前。季禾把图摊在[[flat|平坦的]]石上。沈砚向外村[[apologize|认错]]，自己曾认为不住同谷的[[inhabitant|居民]]与山契无关。他不将整趟路[[condense|压成]]一句勇敢经历，而把红票、病册与每段水位都放好。旁人可以问他，正如他曾问别人。","周伯打开旧[[notebook|笔记本]]，门中已列韩长老的[[penalty|处罚]]和赔金，不能因他有知识就许他[[flee|逃开]]旧责。沈砚照同一[[scale|刻度]]比上游量尺，伤者家属听到孤城死者的名字不免[[weep|流泪]]。罗清很[[aware|清楚]]这些痛不能互抵。顾峦仍略[[limp|跛行]]，却准备参加堂兄的[[marriage|婚礼]]，不只生活在旧案里。一[[herd|群]]牛从修路边经过，顾衡作[[motion|手势]]让它们先走。新的共议要对人的日常[[responsive|有回应]]，不能天天叫所有人停田来听长话。","顾峦将旧押人案分进非法拘人的[[category|类别]]，说所谓强带去治疗，实是[[kidnap|绑架]]。罗清确认原伤册，没人要求他再受一次险。沈砚[[sniff|闻]]了许庭货箱，赤道[[equator|赤道]]外运来的香料气味不改，商行的[[narrative|说辞]]却改为自己一路援助。许庭[[clutch|抓紧]]账匣，说这是[[plausible|似有道理的]]事实。沈砚承认救火和借车，又展开收费页；完整记录两面都有。掌事别院的[[suite|套间]]已退回原屋主，古[[imperial|帝王的]]印也没有给截流者永远占水的权利，上游各门须见原图，不能只听返乡人的概括。","他们约三日后合看水，不以开会代替供水。顾衡请工人轮值，罗清先回本馆，顾峦负责把告示念给不能认字的邻人。周伯拿出旧支渠图，说明哪段是自己亲走过的，哪段只有前人记录，不能把老人一句话当作全图无误。沈砚只见韩长老一刻，告诉他有三处图角要请教，且问答都在众人面前进行。长老看见断扣，脸色疲惫，没有要求交还。他指着一处被旧池遮住的通口说，若真改为上下游同时取水，本门这季修炼份额还要再减。这个价钱明日必须公开。"],"en":["Shen did not [[pretend|pretend]] that returning ended the work. A [[civilian|civilian]] asked about wages while his [[beloved|beloved]] field grew and the clasp stayed [[safe|safe]]. Gu Luan had repaired the bell [[joint|joint]] with [[elastic|elastic]] rope. Signals needed no [[military|military]] order, though a night runner required an [[athlete|athlete]]’s footing. Shen stood the ruler [[upright|upright]]. Xu recognized [[naval|naval]] rope and promised connected trade. Luan asked instead who would pay the local workers.","Ji taught youths to [[forge|forge]] rings while Luan tied a [[knot|knot]]. A [[kid|kid]] offered Luo [[honey|honey]]. [[ore|Ore]] dust marked a [[screw|screw]]. A [[slight|slight]] leak made its keeper [[hesitant|hesitant]], fearing spoiled good news. Shen said nights of [[hell|hell]] had taught him to record faults. Luo brought new [[fabric|fabric]] and checked Zhou’s granddaughter, who proudly showed a repaired bowl cover and a life beyond verifying her grandfather’s story.","The ordinary gate had been [[revolutionary|revolutionary]], but [[following|following]] work required more than applause. Gu would not seal the mountain by [[force|force]]. From the covenant Shen could [[derive|derive]] obligations: unchanged pool [[capacity|capacity]], but a new diversion [[feature|feature]] placed before common drawing. On a [[flat|flat]] stone he would [[apologize|apologize]] to every outside [[inhabitant|inhabitant]] he had dismissed. He refused to [[condense|condense]] the journey into heroism, presenting tickets, illness histories and measurements for questions.","Zhou’s [[notebook|notebook]] listed Han’s existing [[penalty|penalty]] and payments. Knowledge would not let him [[flee|flee]] responsibility. Shen compared the same [[scale|scale]] while families began to [[weep|weep]]. Luo was [[aware|aware]] that losses did not cancel each other. Luan would still [[limp|limp]], yet planned a cousin’s [[marriage|marriage]]. Gu’s [[motion|motion]] let a [[herd|herd]] pass first. Public decisions had to stay [[responsive|responsive]] to daily life, not demand endless attendance.","Luan placed his old seizure in the unlawful detention [[category|category]]: compulsory “treatment” had been to [[kidnap|kidnap]]. Luo retained the original injury record without another ordeal. Shen would [[sniff|sniff]] spices shipped from beyond the [[equator|equator]] as Xu’s [[narrative|narrative]] became uninterrupted aid. Xu began to [[clutch|clutch]] his box, calling that [[plausible|plausible]]. Shen included rescue and hire charges together. Tao’s private [[suite|suite]] was returned; an [[imperial|imperial]] seal did not give perpetual water ownership. Sects must inspect actual diagrams.","They scheduled review in three days while continuing supply. Gu organized shifts, Luo returned to care, and Luan read notices aloud. Zhou distinguished routes he had walked from inherited drawings. Shen invited Han to answer three questions publicly under his existing liabilities. Han did not demand the clasp back. He indicated a hidden connection: simultaneous upstream and downstream drawing would further reduce the home sect’s cultivation share. Tomorrow that cost must be announced."]});
